# Exclusions for the web-link half of the Link check workflow
# (.github/workflows/link-check.yml). One regular expression per line, matched
# against the URL. Every entry says why. tel: and mailto: are excluded in the
# workflow's lychee args; internal links are checked by tools/validate-links.ts.

# temporary — remove when the domain is reattached (dougdevitre.org, the Access To
# hub, has been down since its CNAME was deleted on 2026-04-07).
^https?://(www\.)?dougdevitre\.org

# The install file is published by .github/workflows/skill-package.yml when this
# change reaches main, so it 404s until the first skill-latest release exists.
# TEMPORARY: remove this line once the release is published.
^https://github\.com/dougdevitre/access-to-health/releases/download/skill-latest/
